{# Password reset link, requested with POST /api/auth/password-reset (ADR 0013, #13). Context:
   firstName (may be empty), link, validForMinutes. Rendered by the queue worker (adr/0012). #}
<p>Hello{% if firstName %} {{ firstName }}{% endif %},</p>
<p>Someone asked to reset the password for your Business Tool account. To choose a new password:</p>
<p><a href="{{ link }}">Set a new password</a></p>
<p>The link works once and expires in {{ validForMinutes }} minutes. If it has expired, ask for a new one on the sign-in page.</p>
<p>If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this e-mail: your password stays the same.</p>
